169
00:18:00,890 --> 00:18:04,400
There's one lab machine that broke down so I sent it in for repair.

170
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:07,900
Because I didn't want to wait, I'm on the way to finding it.

171
00:18:07,900 --> 00:18:10,000
What's wrong?

172
00:18:10,810 --> 00:18:16,100
Eun Jo, I have something to tell you in a hurry.

173
00:18:16,100 --> 00:18:17,690
Say it.

174
00:18:17,690 --> 00:18:21,530
Will you come?

175
00:18:21,530 --> 00:18:24,970
Can you not tell me over the phone?

176
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:33,520
I can't. I'd like it if you came right now.

177
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:37,360
I'll go wait at home.

178
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:39,020
Okay.

179
00:18:58,300 --> 00:18:59,520
Hello.

180
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:01,280
Where are you?

181
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:06,760
I have to go home. Right now, Hyo Seon-

182
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:10,230
I'm at your school right now. From here to where you are...

183
00:19:10,230 --> 00:19:12,860
Tell me the quickest way to get to you.

184
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:14,820
I have to say it now.

185
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:17,720
If I don't say it now, I might not ever be able to.

186
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:21,780
That rascal told me not to tell you, but I want to tell you, Eun Jo.

187
00:19:21,780 --> 00:19:23,740
I have to say it.

188
00:19:23,740 --> 00:19:24,960
What are you saying?

189
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:27,300
Where are you? Tell me quickly.

190
00:19:27,300 --> 00:19:30,310
♫  and waited for you  ♫

191
00:19:34,330 --> 00:19:38,950
♫  Even my memory which turned away  ♫

192
00:19:40,770 --> 00:19:44,230
♫  doesn't know that I longed for you  ♫

193
00:19:44,230 --> 00:19:48,700
♫  Looking only in this direction  ♫

194
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:51,490
It's me, Father. Just listen to me.

195
00:19:51,490 --> 00:19:54,010
I don't want to hear your response.

196
00:19:54,010 --> 00:19:58,570
I've been thinking deeply about why I accepted your offer in the first place.

197
00:19:58,570 --> 00:20:02,660
I thought it was because I despised Hyung Gi Jeong, and despised the rest of the family who were so mean to my mom.

198
00:20:02,660 --> 00:20:07,120
So, I thought I'd take revenge as much as I could. That's all I thought.

199
00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:08,490
♫  Will you who knows everything about me  ♫

200
00:20:08,490 --> 00:20:11,040
But, that was a lie.

201
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:14,090
I guess my true intention was to put my name in the family registry

202
00:20:14,090 --> 00:20:16,960
and become a proud member of Hong Distillery.

203
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,760
I'm definitely sure that was it.

204
00:20:18,760 --> 00:20:23,340
But Father, I'm throwing it all away now.

205
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:25,330
Father, you take it all.

206
00:20:25,330 --> 00:20:27,320
My shares, my house.

207
00:20:27,320 --> 00:20:31,560
I don't know how much there is but I will give them all to you.

208
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:34,980
I'll also give up being your son.

209
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:37,620
I'm telling you I'll put everything on the line, Father.

210
00:20:37,620 --> 00:20:39,610
After this time, if you come to me or even a little bit closer

211
00:20:39,610 --> 00:20:42,890
to Dae Seong True Winemakers where I am now,

212
00:20:42,890 --> 00:20:45,200
since I am already not your son,

213
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:47,890
