215
00:20:50,770 --> 00:20:54,460
and reporting the brother to the police for what he did to Dae Seong True Winemakers...

216
00:20:54,460 --> 00:20:57,790
You're going to see all those things happen.

217
00:20:57,790 --> 00:21:02,750
Yes, you can call me crazy.

218
00:21:02,780 --> 00:21:08,050
I am on my way to see the girl who says it's better to see me even if she suffers.

219
00:21:09,090 --> 00:21:13,030
I am going to repent and then...

220
00:21:13,030 --> 00:21:19,400
However, I don't know whether I can still keep staying there or watch over her...

221
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:22,050
But, I'm going to ask her those things.

222
00:21:22,050 --> 00:21:27,410
If only that kid gives me permission, I'll do that.

223
00:21:27,410 --> 00:21:31,550
Father, stay healthy.

224
00:21:31,550 --> 00:21:37,150
♫  If I can always look at you  ♫

225
00:21:37,150 --> 00:21:45,640
♫  The day I return to your side again will come again  ♫

226
