230
00:22:25,850 --> 00:22:28,590
And that it was for a reason I didn't know...

231
00:22:35,180 --> 00:22:39,780
That scared me.

232
00:22:40,500 --> 00:22:42,880
And I didn't like it.

233
00:22:46,280 --> 00:22:51,460
I'm also embarrassed of myself to death.

234
00:22:53,250 --> 00:22:59,740
But, that was bigger than my embarrassment.

235
00:23:02,770 --> 00:23:05,840
What could it be?

236
00:23:05,840 --> 00:23:11,950
What could it be that Gi Hoon was searching for you so urgently.

237
00:23:11,950 --> 00:23:14,970
With such an earnest expression on his face...

238
00:23:17,690 --> 00:23:23,560
Because of those thoughts, I lost my mind.

239
00:23:26,120 --> 00:23:29,510
Despite my humiliation.

240
00:23:31,210 --> 00:23:34,030
I'm confessing to you.

241
00:23:41,310 --> 00:23:43,360
Let's go together.

242
00:23:45,620 --> 00:23:48,220
Come with me.

243
00:23:50,080 --> 00:23:55,170
If your heart is that unstable, stay by my side.

244
00:24:00,300 --> 00:24:06,120
I'm really embarrassed, Eun Jo.

245
00:24:55,340 --> 00:24:58,380
Dae Seong True Winemakers' Unfiltered Wine

246
00:25:01,470 --> 00:25:05,010
Gi Hoon, just this once.

247
00:25:05,010 --> 00:25:08,040
Just this once, let me meet her.

248
00:25:08,040 --> 00:25:11,390
Please set it up for me and then I'll do the rest.

249
00:25:13,810 --> 00:25:18,840
She's the only woman I really fell in love with at first sight.

250
00:25:20,370 --> 00:25:24,140
Do you know what it's like to fall in love at first sight?

251
00:25:24,140 --> 00:25:25,320
Just answer your phone.

252
00:25:25,320 --> 00:25:28,490
Huh? Oh okay.

253
00:25:28,490 --> 00:25:31,330
I'll listen to your words well.

254
00:25:31,330 --> 00:25:32,780
Hello?

255
00:25:32,780 --> 00:25:36,320
Pardon? Yes?

256
00:25:36,320 --> 00:25:39,580
What is she saying? Yes?

257
00:25:41,420 --> 00:25:44,570
Yes. Why?

258
00:25:45,750 --> 00:25:48,060
What's wrong with Dad?

259
00:25:48,060 --> 00:25:49,740
What?

260
00:25:51,470 --> 00:25:54,800
Ah, so why would my dad collapse?!

261
00:26:01,430 --> 00:26:05,510
Did you call Dad?

262
00:26:05,510 --> 00:26:07,670
What are you saying?

263
00:26:07,670 --> 00:26:10,450
They're saying that after talking to you on the phone,

264
00:26:11,370 --> 00:26:14,350
dad went to the bathroom and collapsed.

265
00:26:16,060 --> 00:26:18,030
What?

266
00:26:31,540 --> 00:26:33,760
A makgeolli tasting contest?

267
00:26:33,760 --> 00:26:37,210
Yes. The two of you guys are definitely experts without question.

268
00:26:37,210 --> 00:26:39,610
You must participate not matter what.

269
00:26:39,610 --> 00:26:42,960
Explain what you're saying in more detail.

270
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:45,410
I'll send you the details later over mail.

271
00:26:45,410 --> 00:26:48,380
I'm going to cover a story now. You guys can do your own business or

272
00:26:48,380 --> 00:26:51,560
Whether you drink here or not, do whatever you want.

273
00:26:55,040 --> 00:26:58,090
Eun Jo, was he originally like that?

274
00:26:58,090 --> 00:27:00,700
Isn't he a bit strange?

275
00:27:02,680 --> 00:27:04,700
Kim Dong Soo.

276
00:27:07,560 --> 00:27:10,030
I have something to tell you.

277
00:27:11,190 --> 00:27:14,570
Can you look into something for me?

278
00:27:20,700 --> 00:27:24,890
What happened to us... that Japanese export scam...

279
00:27:24,890 --> 00:27:29,170
Can you look into who did that?

280
00:28:03,860 --> 00:28:07,000
It's a relief that he survived this.

281
00:28:07,770 --> 00:28:10,950
I almost couldn't make the time to even come like this.

282
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:15,350
Gi Tae, you go back and rest too.

283
00:28:19,320 --> 00:28:21,200
Stop there.

284
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:31,660
You almost couldn't even make this time?

285
00:28:31,660 --> 00:28:34,860
Can you say something like that in this situation?

286
00:28:34,860 --> 00:28:39,930
Are you praising yourself that you made the time and came when you are too busy to even make the time?

287
00:28:39,930 --> 00:28:40,950
Lower your voice.

288
00:28:40,950 --> 00:28:44,330
Who was the one who made Dad faint?

289
00:28:44,330 --> 00:28:46,260
Well, I don't know.

290
00:28:47,810 --> 00:28:50,410
Who was it because of?

291
00:28:50,410 --> 00:28:52,880
Do you think I wouldn't know?

292
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:57,430
You and Mom, day in and day out putting your heads together and plotting to oust dad from Hong Distillery...

293
00:28:57,430 --> 00:29:00,410
Do you think I wouldn't know?!

294
00:29:00,410 --> 00:29:04,890
Lower your voice. You're in front of a patient.

295
00:29:06,580 --> 00:29:08,980
A patient?

296
00:29:08,980 --> 00:29:10,750
Is Dad

297
00:29:12,450 --> 00:29:14,470
just a patient to you?

298
00:29:19,030 --> 00:29:22,140
Why is a loud noise coming from a hospital room?

299
00:29:23,920 --> 00:29:28,620
I don't need it all. You're all like beggars.

300
00:29:35,630 --> 00:29:37,630
We need to meet with Lawyer Kim.

301
00:29:37,630 --> 00:29:40,460
Let's hold off for now.

302
00:29:40,460 --> 00:29:44,020
We can't prepare for a lawsuit while he's lying down here.

303
00:29:44,020 --> 00:29:46,700
There could be negative rumors.

304
00:29:46,720 --> 00:29:50,820
I wanted to wrap this up before the next shareholder's meeting.

305
00:29:50,850 --> 00:29:53,920
If it goes wrong again, how much longer do we have to wait?

306
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:56,830
If we take any action as soon as he recovers, it won't look good either.

307
00:29:56,830 --> 00:29:59,430
Let's stop everything for the time being, Mother.

308
00:30:00,900 --> 00:30:04,390
I thought I told you not to let anyone get in here.

309
00:30:06,520 --> 00:30:11,140
First, since Lawyer Kim is waiting let's go and meet him.

310
00:30:11,140 --> 00:30:14,130
We have to listen to what he has to say.

311
00:30:32,180 --> 00:30:34,230
Father.

312
00:30:35,320 --> 00:30:37,550
What is this?

313
00:30:41,790 --> 00:30:44,900
Is this how you lived your life? Until now?

314
00:30:52,870 --> 00:30:55,040
What is it?

315
00:30:55,850 --> 00:30:59,120
Someone came.

316
00:31:00,700 --> 00:31:07,240
Someone came and he's here asking to see the madam of the house.

317
00:31:15,300 --> 00:31:18,440
That person... What did he do?

318
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:23,490
He said his relative sister called Song Kang Sook lives in this house

319
00:31:23,490 --> 00:31:29,450
and she is filthy rich. Just one word from him and she'll bring him money.

320
00:31:29,450 --> 00:31:31,420
He played quite a bit.

321
00:31:31,420 --> 00:31:36,000
We're holding onto a wrist of his and he's asking for some money.

322
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:38,170
Your younger sibling.

323
00:31:46,590 --> 00:31:48,950
I understand. I understand, so go.

324
00:31:48,950 --> 00:31:50,050
Go, quickly.

325
00:31:50,050 --> 00:31:53,770
I'll take care of it myself, so go quickly.

326
00:32:13,910 --> 00:32:16,230
Eun Jo.

327
00:32:16,230 --> 00:32:23,210
Among Mom's relatives is there anyone named Jang Taek Geun?

328
00:32:25,870 --> 00:32:27,960
What did you say?

329
00:32:34,570 --> 00:32:37,810
So, what will you do?

330
00:32:37,810 --> 00:32:42,870
What would I do? It's nothing, so don't worry about it.

331
00:32:42,870 --> 00:32:45,070
It's nothing?

332
00:32:45,070 --> 00:32:49,500
You're saying it's nothing? This is nothing?

333
00:32:49,500 --> 00:32:51,280
I'll take care of it myself.

334
00:32:51,280 --> 00:32:53,460
What will you do if Hyo Seon becomes suspicious?

335
00:32:53,460 --> 00:32:56,420
What will you do if Hyo Seon finds out?

336
00:32:56,420 --> 00:33:00,700
How would she know? I'll take care of it myself so you-

337
00:33:03,070 --> 00:33:04,950
What are you going to do?

338
00:33:04,950 --> 00:33:07,310
What are you going to do about it?

339
00:33:17,670 --> 00:33:22,140
I filled the tub for you. Wash before it gets cold.

340
00:33:22,140 --> 00:33:26,340
- Hyo Seon.
- Yeah?

341
00:33:26,340 --> 00:33:32,250
Mom's condition is a bit off and she's not feeling well right now.

342
00:33:32,250 --> 00:33:35,960
You're not going to like it if you go in there.

343
00:33:37,780 --> 00:33:39,610
Okay.

344
00:33:40,630 --> 00:33:44,010
Is Mom sick?

345
00:33:44,010 --> 00:33:49,190
She's not hurt, she's just a bit off.

346
00:33:49,190 --> 00:33:54,030
There's something you need to do.

347
00:33:58,050 --> 00:34:02,590
We can't lease the Japanese equipment soon enough but that person...

348
00:34:02,590 --> 00:34:03,660
Your call is being directed to the voice mail box.

349
00:34:03,660 --> 00:34:07,650
That person... I haven't been able to get in touch with him all day.

350
00:34:07,650 --> 00:34:09,890
You try calling him.

351
00:34:11,180 --> 00:34:13,750
Your call could not be connected.

352
00:34:17,320 --> 00:34:19,350
Jeong Woo.

353
00:34:20,220 --> 00:34:22,490
Jeong Woo!

354
00:34:22,490 --> 00:34:24,570
Jeong Woo.

355
00:34:34,180 --> 00:34:37,580
Okay, I'll go.

356
00:34:38,770 --> 00:34:42,790
As soon as you get up in the morning.

357
00:34:42,790 --> 00:34:46,540
That's right. Don't worry.

358
00:34:46,540 --> 00:34:50,700
If we don't give them the money, they'll keep coming back.

359
00:34:50,700 --> 00:34:55,150
I said don't worry. I'll resolve it, just believe me.

360
00:34:56,020 --> 00:34:59,070
I won't allow him even show his face before your house.

361
00:34:59,070 --> 00:35:00,870
Don't worry.

362
00:35:06,300 --> 00:35:08,070
No,

363
00:35:09,690 --> 00:35:12,220
I'll go with you.

364
00:35:12,220 --> 00:35:14,150
Let's do that.

365
00:35:16,890 --> 00:35:21,250
Why would you go somewhere like that? I said just believe me.

366
00:35:21,250 --> 00:35:22,830
I...

367
00:35:24,330 --> 00:35:28,550
I will meet Ajusshi Jang because I want to talk to him.

368
00:35:30,900 --> 00:35:32,990
Sleep early.

369
00:35:34,410 --> 00:35:36,230
Eun Jo.

370
00:35:40,510 --> 00:35:44,590
Something is wrong, right?

371
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:48,360
What's wrong?

372
00:35:50,270 --> 00:35:52,090
No.

373
00:36:16,650 --> 00:36:20,360
Make some noise, girl. You almost scared me to death.

374
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:24,490
Give me all the money those people askd for.

375
00:36:24,490 --> 00:36:27,260
Are you crazy? Why would I give you that money?

376
00:36:27,260 --> 00:36:30,590
You can't let them keep coming back here!

377
00:36:30,590 --> 00:36:33,050
He can sue me for all I care.

378
00:36:33,050 --> 00:36:37,600
You want to make a scene and alert all the elders of the family?

379
00:36:38,660 --> 00:36:40,680
Get the money ready.

380
00:37:26,360 --> 00:37:30,030
2002

381
00:37:32,240 --> 00:37:35,140
Goo Dae Seong

382
00:37:43,260 --> 00:37:46,510
A person came into my life.

383
00:37:52,990 --> 00:37:54,980
Like the spring breeze.

384
00:37:54,980 --> 00:37:58,610
There is a scent of flowers in the spring breeze.

385
00:37:59,700 --> 00:38:04,000
Like being echanted by the floral breeze, I became enchanted by that person.

386
00:38:05,930 --> 00:38:10,930
I swore to massage her swollen feet forever.

387
00:38:10,930 --> 00:38:14,170
How would you know that!

388
00:38:16,680 --> 00:38:21,830
I have too many vows. That's how a foolish man is.

389
00:38:21,830 --> 00:38:25,370
This foolish man makes another vow.

390
00:38:25,370 --> 00:38:29,760
To make sure there are no tears in that woman's eyes.

391
00:39:01,340 --> 00:39:03,560
2006

392
00:39:03,560 --> 00:39:05,610
2007

393
00:39:08,030 --> 00:39:12,470
2008

394
00:39:12,470 --> 00:39:14,700
2009

395
00:39:34,830 --> 00:39:36,780
Oppa.

396
00:39:42,500 --> 00:39:47,700
Oppa, where have you been?

397
00:39:47,700 --> 00:39:50,820
You didn't even pick up your phone all day.

398
00:39:53,510 --> 00:39:58,260
Was something wrong?

399
00:40:03,520 --> 00:40:05,700
What's wrong?

400
00:40:13,830 --> 00:40:15,830
Oppa.

401
00:40:18,120 --> 00:40:19,980
Why are you like this?

402
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:49,810
You didn't say anything to Eun Jo, did you?

403
00:41:53,550 --> 00:41:55,530
Did you?

404
00:41:57,120 --> 00:41:59,620
Is that the most important thing?

405
00:42:01,420 --> 00:42:03,760
That I'm part of the Hong Joo Ga family...

406
00:42:04,650 --> 00:42:07,160
The reason why I came to this house...

407
00:42:07,200 --> 00:42:09,800
What I did to Ahjussi...

408
00:42:11,090 --> 00:42:13,260
You do know all that but,

409
00:42:14,250 --> 00:42:16,730
Eun Jo's welfare is the only thing that matters to you.

410
00:42:16,730 --> 00:42:19,590
And as long as Eun Jo is safe,

411
00:42:19,590 --> 00:42:23,520
it's okay for you to share a room with someone like me?

412
00:42:23,520 --> 00:42:25,640
Would it be okay?

413
00:42:25,640 --> 00:42:31,000
But, ... why are you letting me off?

414
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:33,660
I thought you said you were going to give it back.

415
00:42:36,670 --> 00:42:40,440
I believe those words.

416
00:42:41,720 --> 00:42:43,620
Do you believe them?

417
00:42:43,620 --> 00:42:48,170
If I don't, then I'll feel too bad for Noona who likes you.

418
00:42:50,980 --> 00:42:54,790
Even though I can't understand at all

419
00:42:54,790 --> 00:42:57,400
why on earth she likes someone like you.

420
00:43:23,320 --> 00:43:26,410
Mr. Hong! Testing equipment...

421
00:43:26,410 --> 00:43:29,000
Hi, Mr. Hong! I'm Dakai Miura. This is confirmation that the testing equipment you requested is ready to be leased.

422
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:31,610
We will have the equipment shipped to you by air as soon as possible. Thank you. Good luck...

423
00:43:35,220 --> 00:43:37,880
The equipment issue is resolved.

424
00:43:37,880 --> 00:43:41,760
Now, all Eun Jo has to do is to run her tests. Go find Eun Jo.

425
00:43:41,760 --> 00:43:45,520
Okay, she said she'd come at night.

426
00:43:45,520 --> 00:43:47,090
Is that so?

427
00:43:48,960 --> 00:43:52,120
Get up. Let's go to buy rice.

428
00:44:06,500 --> 00:44:09,760
Gu Eun Jo Interview

429
00:44:09,760 --> 00:44:13,380
Honest Business! "Dae Seong True Winemakers"

430
00:44:21,270 --> 00:44:25,170
Ahjussi, if you just this once, give us rice under the same conditions

431
00:44:25,170 --> 00:44:29,370
when President Goo Dae Seong was around,

432
00:44:29,370 --> 00:44:32,130
we will never forget your kindness.

433
00:44:33,800 --> 00:44:39,590
Why are you sitting turned around?

434
00:44:39,590 --> 00:44:42,020
Look at me, please?

435
00:44:43,720 --> 00:44:48,640
The consumers of our rice wine insist that only eco-friendly rice in Gyeonggi-do should be used as raw material.

436
00:44:48,640 --> 00:44:53,430
I believe this could be the chance for your rice to gain world-wide fame.

437
00:44:56,730 --> 00:44:58,990
Ahjussi.

438
00:45:00,530 --> 00:45:07,100
I know you came to my dad's funeral secretly.

439
00:45:10,230 --> 00:45:13,620
Why did you just leave without letting me know?

440
00:45:15,070 --> 00:45:22,250
But if I had seen you there, I probably would have cried until I passed out

441
00:45:22,250 --> 00:45:24,680
thinking of Dad.

442
00:45:30,030 --> 00:45:32,990
I'm really thankful

443
00:45:35,330 --> 00:45:38,340
that you came and said farewell.

444
00:45:38,340 --> 00:45:40,420
Ahjussi.

445
00:46:06,400 --> 00:46:08,360
Eat up.

446
00:46:09,260 --> 00:46:12,440
Okay, I'll eat.

447
00:46:13,260 --> 00:46:16,970
I'll do everything as you say.

448
00:46:22,360 --> 00:46:24,160
Gi Hoon...

449
00:46:25,450 --> 00:46:30,050
you're not going to go anywhere, are you?

450
00:46:31,700 --> 00:46:33,780
Then, that's fine.

451
00:46:35,670 --> 00:46:38,950
I'm growing every day,

452
00:46:38,950 --> 00:46:43,000
and if you stay by my side and not go anywhere,

453
00:46:43,000 --> 00:46:47,980
I'll also become a cool kid like Eun Jo.

454
00:46:51,030 --> 00:46:54,220
I come on to you too strongly, don't I?

455
00:46:55,350 --> 00:46:58,070
I won't do that.

456
00:46:58,070 --> 00:47:00,280
I said I won't do that.

457
00:47:16,100 --> 00:47:19,460
You're a very good person, Hyo Seon.

458
00:47:22,580 --> 00:47:29,400
Nobody among us approaches a person with sincerity like you, knocks on their heart

459
00:47:29,400 --> 00:47:34,340
or moves them. Except you.

460
00:47:35,960 --> 00:47:38,690
Why are you being like this?

461
00:47:38,690 --> 00:47:44,490
Since you're complimenting me, I'm afraid there'll be a twist.

462
00:47:44,490 --> 00:47:46,070
I'm scared.

463
00:47:46,070 --> 00:47:49,640
I'm so envious of your good qualities.

464
00:47:49,640 --> 00:47:54,770
You're a good person. Believe that.

465
00:47:58,800 --> 00:48:02,750
You said I knocked on your heart.

466
00:48:03,660 --> 00:48:07,760
But, why aren't you touched?

467
00:48:07,760 --> 00:48:09,800
I was touched.

468
00:48:13,110 --> 00:48:15,690
I was touched.

469
00:48:15,690 --> 00:48:19,560
The fact that you liked me, believed in me,

470
00:48:19,560 --> 00:48:22,560
I know your sincerity.

471
00:48:25,750 --> 00:48:27,070
You know?

472
00:48:27,070 --> 00:48:29,740
It's because I know that I'm saying this.

473
00:48:30,790 --> 00:48:35,220
It's because I know that I'm also rejecting you like this.

474
00:48:35,220 --> 00:48:37,330
Like right now.

475
00:48:38,380 --> 00:48:40,120
What?

476
00:48:40,120 --> 00:48:43,420
I'll be loyal to the two of you.

477
00:48:43,420 --> 00:48:47,690
No matter how the future turns out, what frightening things it brings,

478
00:48:47,690 --> 00:48:54,100
even if I receive an unforgiving punishment all my life, I will bear it.

479
00:48:54,100 --> 00:48:57,320
What does that mean?

480
00:48:57,320 --> 00:49:03,420
Thank you for your feelings, and sorry that I couldn't accept them.

481
00:49:09,290 --> 00:49:12,000
Is it because of Eun Jo?

482
00:49:14,870 --> 00:49:16,750
No.

483
00:49:18,760 --> 00:49:23,270
You're going to reject Eun Jo too?

484
00:49:23,270 --> 00:49:30,140
I got rejected by Eun Jo.

485
00:49:35,680 --> 00:49:43,600
So, right now, I got rejected by you, right?

486
00:49:44,440 --> 00:49:46,120
That's right.

487
00:49:49,000 --> 00:49:54,580
Officially, right?

488
00:49:54,580 --> 00:49:57,330
That's right, officially.

489
00:50:10,090 --> 00:50:12,880
Nothing I'm holding onto...

490
00:50:14,380 --> 00:50:17,630
I really have nothing stable.

491
00:50:20,770 --> 00:50:25,190
Eun Jo, Mom,

492
00:50:27,810 --> 00:50:30,400
and even you.

493
00:50:31,910 --> 00:50:34,520
You're standing well by yourself.

494
00:50:37,850 --> 00:50:42,590
A little wobbly perhaps. But you are going well.

495
00:50:44,410 --> 00:50:49,370
Stay well, Hyo Seonn. You're growing up very well.

496
00:51:16,300 --> 00:51:20,370
2007
2008
2009

497
00:52:18,100 --> 00:52:19,970
Follow me.

498
00:53:02,600 --> 00:53:04,640
Ahjussi.

499
00:53:21,600 --> 00:53:25,900
Eat slowly. No one's going to take it from you.

500
00:53:28,450 --> 00:53:32,450
But, who did you say you were?

501
00:53:33,330 --> 00:53:35,460
Just eat.

502
00:53:50,420 --> 00:53:54,610
Jeong Woo, just stay standing there.

503
00:54:00,100 --> 00:54:02,130
Get in.

504
00:54:02,130 --> 00:54:03,840
Okay.

505
00:54:05,450 --> 00:54:07,590
I said get in.

506
00:54:16,800 --> 00:54:18,500
Okay.

507
00:54:34,620 --> 00:54:36,470
Eun Jo!

508
00:54:39,430 --> 00:54:43,690
If by any chance I don't come back to pick you up after two or three hours, find your way home by yourself.

509
00:54:43,690 --> 00:54:46,870
What did you say-? What are you doing right now?

510
00:55:18,100 --> 00:55:20,730
Eun Jo, Eun Jo!

511
00:55:20,730 --> 00:55:23,430
Why are you like this?

512
00:55:42,080 --> 00:55:43,840
Get off.

513
00:55:43,840 --> 00:55:47,350
Why are you telling me to get off?

514
00:55:47,350 --> 00:55:49,730
I said get off!

515
00:56:24,800 --> 00:56:27,470
Please save me, Mister.

516
00:56:28,680 --> 00:56:31,320
Save me.

517
00:56:31,320 --> 00:56:34,340
I feel like I might die.

518
00:56:34,340 --> 00:56:37,540
I feel like I'm going to die every day.

519
00:56:39,780 --> 00:56:42,310
I'm barely surviving.

520
00:56:43,500 --> 00:56:46,350
I'm living because I can't die.

521
00:56:48,160 --> 00:56:51,230
If you add your burden on top of mine...

522
00:56:53,440 --> 00:56:55,290
I...

523
00:57:03,590 --> 00:57:05,350
I..

524
00:57:08,050 --> 00:57:10,750
I'm my mom's daughter, mister.

525
00:57:17,560 --> 00:57:22,830
Song Kang Sook's daughter, Eun Jo.

526
00:57:28,220 --> 00:57:30,210
Cold-hearted bitch...

527
00:57:32,160 --> 00:57:33,980
Eun Jo.

528
00:57:36,910 --> 00:57:39,890
When you were drunk and slept,

529
00:57:43,180 --> 00:57:46,830
there were times when I just wanted to kill you.

530
00:57:46,830 --> 00:57:49,410
You didn't know that, did you, Mister?

531
00:57:51,740 --> 00:57:58,350
I really even held a knife up.

532
00:58:00,520 --> 00:58:02,740
When you were drunk,

533
00:58:04,220 --> 00:58:07,320
and you laid a hand on my mom.

534
00:58:11,320 --> 00:58:13,090
This hand.

535
00:58:14,900 --> 00:58:16,830
This hand...

536
00:58:19,560 --> 00:58:24,320
I was going to cut it off, I wielded a knife.

537
00:58:27,600 --> 00:58:31,190
That young brat who was only 10 or so,

538
00:58:33,850 --> 00:58:37,900
to cut his hand off...

539
00:58:39,280 --> 00:58:43,040
I had such ugly thoughts everyday.

540
00:58:45,950 --> 00:58:47,690
Did you know?

541
00:58:59,230 --> 00:59:04,750
If I were to live having such nightmares again,

542
00:59:08,100 --> 00:59:11,970
it's better not to live at all, Ahjussi.

543
00:59:16,290 --> 00:59:18,360
I'm being sincere.

544
00:59:20,670 --> 00:59:24,520
Eun Jo, I was wrong-

545
00:59:24,520 --> 00:59:26,920
Shut your mouth, Ahjussi.

546
00:59:28,960 --> 00:59:32,830
You're not supposed to say you did wrong.

547
00:59:32,830 --> 00:59:35,140
If you did wrong, then you should never do that again.

548
00:59:35,140 --> 00:59:38,600
But even though you did wrong, you did it again!

549
00:59:38,600 --> 00:59:44,830
Even though you said you did wrong now, next time too...

550
00:59:46,220 --> 00:59:48,730
you'll do the same mistake again.

551
00:59:54,760 --> 00:59:59,840
Ahjussi, watch me.

552
01:00:03,090 --> 01:00:10,550
How your wrong-doing can easily kill a person...

553
01:00:13,690 --> 01:00:15,780
I'll show you.

554
01:00:37,680 --> 01:00:39,810
Young girl!

555
01:00:52,290 --> 01:00:53,480
Young girl.

556
01:00:53,480 --> 01:00:55,390
- Young girl.
- Let go of me!

557
01:00:55,390 --> 01:00:58,560
Let go! Let go!

558
01:00:58,560 --> 01:01:01,920
Let go of me!

559
01:01:03,370 --> 01:01:05,810
I'm going to kill myself.

560
01:01:05,810 --> 01:01:09,310
Let go! I'm going to die!

561
01:01:56,290 --> 01:01:59,540
2010

562
01:02:21,220 --> 01:02:27,580
A lacking man that I am... I helplessly look on while she's reeling.

563
01:02:29,070 --> 01:02:34,570
That person's repeated lies are all a disgrace to me.

564
01:02:34,570 --> 01:02:41,230
When that person sometimes goes to meet her old man from before then comes back home and smiles at me,

565
01:02:41,260 --> 01:02:45,440
emotions of anger, despair, and sadness

566
01:02:45,440 --> 01:02:48,450
take turns in overcoming me.

567
01:02:50,010 --> 01:02:53,520
I'd like to ask that person why does she that,

568
01:02:53,520 --> 01:02:58,620
but this foolish man is too scared to open his mouth that can't even say a word.

569
01:03:02,800 --> 01:03:05,760
The moment I open my mouth to speak,

570
01:03:05,760 --> 01:03:11,130
The life I've been living with that woman for the past 8 years

571
01:03:11,130 --> 01:03:14,980
will become a lie and disappear.

572
01:03:28,690 --> 01:03:32,910
The fact that my life will continue without her in it,

573
01:03:35,220 --> 01:03:38,820
That's what I'm most afraid of.

574
01:04:25,930 --> 01:04:29,340
♫  It must be you  ♫

575
01:04:29,340 --> 01:04:33,230
♫  I cannot be without you  ♫

576
01:04:33,230 --> 01:04:39,820
♫  Like this for another day, month or year  ♫

577
01:04:39,820 --> 01:04:42,540
Can't you give up everything?

578
01:04:42,540 --> 01:04:44,260
I won't do that.

579
01:04:44,260 --> 01:04:46,390
I was rejected.

580
01:04:46,390 --> 01:04:49,730
I feel like my heart is ripping, Unni.

581
01:04:49,730 --> 01:04:52,440
Noona, are you okay?

582
01:04:53,320 --> 01:04:54,230
Move aside!

583
01:04:54,230 --> 01:04:57,750
♫  My bruised heart  ♫

584
01:04:57,750 --> 01:05:01,040
What will happen if I stab you in the back and reveal who you are?

585
01:05:01,040 --> 01:05:02,050
I won't leave him be.

586
01:05:02,050 --> 01:05:05,360
I'm just not going to let him do this.

587
01:05:06,590 --> 01:05:10,020
♫  Wherever you are  ♫

588
01:05:10,020 --> 01:05:12,900
♫  Can't you hear my voice?  ♫
